    },
    {
      "displayText": "野生特区真棒！\n我天天都在捉鲤鱼王。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CE751F7279533A771F68D2FF01000A62115929592990FD572863499CA49C7C738B3002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你看我捉的！\n这可是特大号的鲤鱼王！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我用“查看能力”确认了一下，\n它是XL尺寸，所以毫无疑问是特大号！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60770B621163497684FF01000A8FD953EF662F7279592753F776849CA49C7C738BFF0100100001BE01000A62117528201C67E5770B80FD529B201D786E8BA44E864E004E0BFF0C000A5B83662F0058004C5C3A5BF8FF0C62404EE56BEB65E0759195EE662F7279592753F7FF01FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它不但块头特别大，\n还跳得特别高！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834E0D4F46575759347279522B5927FF0C000A8FD88DF35F977279522B9AD8FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀～比我的鲤鱼王\n块头还大的鲤鱼王，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n应该是绝对不存在的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF5E6BD4621176849CA49C7C738B000A575759348FD8592776849CA49C7C738BFF0C00100001BE00000A5E948BE5662F7EDD5BF94E0D5B5857287684FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是能捉到比XL尺寸还大的鲤鱼王，\n一定要给我看看啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F80FD634952306BD40058004C5C3A5BF88FD8592776849CA49C7C738BFF0C000A4E005B9A89817ED96211770B770B554AFF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然只是个传闻，但……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我听说在2号野生特区\n有特大尺寸的鲤鱼王。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713653EA662F4E2A4F2095FBFF0C4F462026202600100001BE01000A6211542C8BF45728003253F791CE751F7279533A000A6709727959275C3A5BF876849CA49C7C738B3002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是能捉到比我的鲤鱼王\n块头还大的鲤鱼王，就带来给我看看啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F80FD634952306BD4621176849CA49C7C738B000A575759348FD8592776849CA49C7C738BFF0C5C315E2667657ED96211770B770B554AFF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其他的鲤鱼王\n绝对不可能比我的鲤鱼王块头大。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51764ED676849CA49C7C738B000A7EDD5BF94E0D53EF80FD6BD4621176849CA49C7C738B5757593459273002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "跟我的鲤鱼王相比，\n这尺寸看起来还差得远呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8DDF621176849CA49C7C738B76F86BD4FF0C000A8FD95C3A5BF8770B8D7767658FD85DEE5F978FDC5462FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然捉不到的吧！\n哈！哈！哈！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C713663494E0D523076845427FF01000A54C8FF0154C8FF0154C8FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唔嗯！\n这只鲤鱼王……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "551455EFFF01000A8FD953EA9CA49C7C738B20262026001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好险……算是差一丁点\n就要赢过我的鲤鱼王了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D9669202620267B97662F5DEE4E004E0170B9000A5C3189818D628FC7621176849CA49C7C738B4E863002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎……怎么回事！？\n这是什么尺寸！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E20262026600E4E4856DE4E8BFF01FF1F000A8FD9662F4EC04E485C3A5BF8FF01FF1F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么？头……目？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48FF1F59342026202676EEFF1F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拿头目过来算什么嘛！这是犯规！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62FF593476EE8FC767657B974EC04E48561BFF018FD9662F72AF89C4FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且对决还没完呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E145BF951B38FD86CA15B8C5462FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鲤鱼王的精髓在于它的招式，跃起！\n我们用跃起来一决胜负吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9CA49C7C738B76847CBE9AD357284E8E5B83768462DB5F0FFF0C8DC38D77FF01000A62114EEC75288DC38D7767654E0051B380DC8D1F5427FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好嘞～开始！上吧！\n我的XL尺寸鲤鱼王！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D561EFF5E5F0059CBFF014E0A5427FF01000A621176840058004C5C3A5BF89CA49C7C738BFF01FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这……这也太高了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9202620268FD94E5F592A9AD84E8620262026001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是我输了……\n我彻底被打败了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F62118F934E8620262026000A62115F7B5E9588AB62538D254E863002001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没想到头目不只是块头大，\n还能跳得这么高……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA160F35230593476EE4E0D53EA662F575759345927FF0C000A8FD880FD8DF35F978FD94E489AD820262026001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "头目对吧……\n这下我也有新目标了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "593476EE5BF9542720262026000A8FD94E0B62114E5F670965B076EE68074E86FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了结成巨型鲤鱼王军团，\n我要向2号野生特区，进发！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E867ED362105DE8578B9CA49C7C738B519B56E2FF0C000A621189815411003253F791CE751F7279533AFF0C8FDB53D1FF01001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
